<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP appoints financial manager.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP appoints financial manager.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd said on Friday it had appointed Anna Lou Fletcher as corporate general manager, financial planning and analysis.</p>
<p>Executive general manager finance Graeme McGregor said Fletcher had experience in corporate finance and involvement in a range of power, gas and energy transactions.</p>
<p>Fletcher, who will be based in Melbourne and take up her position in mid-January, was formerly managing director of New Harbor Inc of New York.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
